cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Transradial Limb Sim"
abstract: >-
  A physics simulation of transradial prosthesis actuation that follows the power
  from a six cell battery through an H bridge, a brushed motor, a planetary
  gearhead and a routed tendon to the fingertip, computing every link's share
  from published component data so a drive train can be judged before it is
  built.
type: software
authors:
